<section class="av_textblock_section av-m895l2hr-1e96352870d4e57f85db483c0f1e9d4d" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p data-wp-editing="1"><img alt="Dr. Bankole Johnson, the founder of Casa Privée, the top concierge medical clinic in Miami, Florida." class="wp-image-1169 alignleft" decoding="async" height="350" sizes="(max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dr-johnson.jpg" srcset="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dr-johnson.jpg 682w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dr-johnson-184x300.jpg 184w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dr-johnson-632x1030.jpg 632w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dr-johnson-432x705.jpg 432w" width="215"/><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bankole_Johnson" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Dr. Bankole A. Johnson</a> is a globally renowned expert at the intersection of neuroscience, molecular genetics, computational mathematics, neuropsychiatry, and cutting-edge medical science. Over the course of a remarkable career spanning more than four decades, he has made extraordinary contributions to research, clinical practice, and education, cementing his reputation as a leader and pioneer in his fields. Dr. Johnson’s work is driven by a deep commitment to advancing medical knowledge and developing innovative solutions to improve health outcomes for individuals worldwide.</p>
<p data-wp-editing="1">His groundbreaking research spans areas such as <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neuropsychopharmacology" rel="noopener" target="_blank">neuropsychopharmacology</a>, molecular genetics, computational neuroscience, and precision medicine, significantly enhancing the understanding and treatment of neurological disorders and addiction. Dr. Johnson holds over 100 global patents in neuroscience and molecular genetics, highlighting his capacity to bridge basic and translational sciences to positively impact clinical outcomes.</p>
<p data-wp-editing="1">Throughout his prestigious career, Dr. Johnson has served in significant leadership roles at renowned institutions, including chairing psychiatry departments and leading brain science consortia. At the University of Maryland, he was Professor of Anatomy and Neuroscience, Pharmacology, Neurology, Medicine, and Psychiatry, reflecting his wide-ranging expertise and integrative approach to healthcare and research.</p>
<p data-wp-editing="1">Dr. Johnson is deeply committed to education and mentorship, shaping future medical professionals and researchers across multiple disciplines. He has authored over 300 peer-reviewed publications and several influential books, contributing broadly to medical knowledge and practice.</p>
<p data-wp-editing="1">His latest endeavor, <a href="<?php echo $basePath; ?>index.php">Casa Privée Clinics</a>, encapsulates his holistic approach to addiction and preventive medicine, combining innovative medical treatments, advanced technology, and individualized patient care. At <a href="<?php echo $basePath; ?>index.php">Casa Privée</a>, Dr. Johnson integrates his extensive expertise to deliver comprehensive wellness, emphasizing preventive care and personalized medical services to achieve optimal health outcomes.</p>
<p data-wp-editing="1">Dr. Bankole A. Johnson continues to shape the fields of neuroscience, neuropsychiatry, and addiction medicine through innovation, dedication, and unparalleled expertise, solidifying his role as a global leader and trailblazer in medical science.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column av-h6govw-a0d83b2d4d2a772fb9862911d71da7b1 av_one_full avia-builder-el-5 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_third first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m895suyv-5e40447a76ff787da8a022f8dc485021 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-6 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Educational Background</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m895seqt-b7b33b501238ccf8901402a75b71e038" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><h3>Degrees and Certifications:</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>University of Glasgow, Scotland (1977-1982):</strong> Earned his medical degree (MD equivalent) with distinction and achieved full UK registration in 1983.</li>
<li><strong>Royal College of Psychiatrists (UK) (1989):</strong> Gained Board Certification in Psychiatry with an M.R.C.Psych.</li>
<li><strong>University of London (1991):</strong> Completed a Master of Philosophy in Neuropsychiatry.</li>
<li><strong>Oxford University Fellowship (1993):</strong> Worked for his Ph.D. equivalent in Biomedical Sciences, advancing groundbreaking research.</li>
<li><strong>Doctor of Science (D.Sc.), University of Glasgow (2004):</strong> The UK’s highest doctoral honor, recognizing his unparalleled contributions to medical science.</li>
<li>Master of Philosophy degree in computational mathematics and neurological  diseases in children</li>
</ul>
<h3>Additional Certifications:</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Forensic medicine</strong></li>
<li><strong>Psychiatry</strong></li>
<li><strong>Addiction medicine</strong></li>
<li><strong>Preventive medicine</strong></li>
<li><strong>Intensive care medicine</strong></li>
<li><strong>Anesthesiology</strong></li>
</ul>
<h3>Board Certifications:</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>American Board of Stem Cell Physicians</strong></li>
<li><strong>American Board of Disability Analysts</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>Dr. Johnson’s exemplary educational path reflects his unrelenting pursuit of knowledge and innovation. He began his journey with a degree in biology, where he demonstrated exceptional academic achievements and a passion for scientific discovery. Following this, he pursued a master’s degree in molecular science, dedicating countless hours to research and experimentation. His drive for deeper understanding led him to complete a PhD in biochemistry, where he published groundbreaking work in peer-reviewed journals.</p>
<p>His unwavering dedication to learning has made him a leader and innovator in the scientific community.</p>
</div></section></div><p></p>
<div class="flex_column av-mho3wtni-eb9b6a6de633dcec7569c3a42c008d8d av_one_third avia-builder-el-8 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_third first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-mhnw12r8-d1c4ec3dc831e661f545ab07de004359 av-styling- av-img-linked avia-align-center avia-builder-el-9 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><a aria-label="University of Glasgow Scientiae Doctorem" class="avia_image lightbox-added" data-sizes="(max-width: 1030px) 100vw, 1030px" data-srcset="https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science-1030x743.webp 1030w, https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science-300x216.webp 300w, https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science-768x554.webp 768w, https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science-705x509.webp 705w, https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science.webp 1067w" href="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science-1030x743.webp"><img alt="Bankole Akindeinde Johnson, M.B., Ch.B., M.D., Doctor of Science (D.Sc.) from the University of Glasgow, UK. Awarded December 3rd, 2004." class="wp-image-2226 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-2226 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="770" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 1067px) 100vw, 1067px" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science.webp" srcset="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science.webp 1067w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science-300x216.webp 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science-1030x743.webp 1030w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/11/bankole-doctor-of-science-768x554.webp 768w, ../wp-con